summary:
  The logo hunt takes a landlord's page like the station's own, so the
  landlord's icons become the station's logo.

history:
  laut.fm/mangoradio names laut.fm's own 180 px apple-touch-icon and has
  the station's picture as og:image (measured 2026-11-03). Saved with no
  click, the landlord's icon would have stood for good, since the hunt only
  fills an empty logo.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FaviconLogic.js

find:
      if (landlordPage(home))

replace:
      if (false)

expect:
  Killed by tst_faviconlogic::test_a_landlords_page_offers_only_its_og_image.
  Line-neutral.
